00:33:28,080 --> 00:33:32,080
Understanding these fundamentals gives

883
00:33:29,919 --> 00:33:34,880
you a strong foundation for grasping how

884
00:33:32,080 --> 00:33:36,880
MRI actually works. You now know how

885
00:33:34,880 --> 00:33:38,640
each component contributes, how the

886
00:33:36,880 --> 00:33:40,799
hardware creates, manipulates, and

887
